1
00:00:11,581 --> 00:00:16,022
Dawn is drowning in the mirror of my eyes

2
00:00:17,722 --> 00:00:22,182
Pixel worlds - my old disguise

3
00:00:23,802 --> 00:00:29,343
Shadows dance, but I’m not asleep

4
00:00:30,003 --> 00:00:34,183
Feeling the truth - in dreams, not in keep

5
00:00:36,604 --> 00:00:40,304
Everything around - a reflected code

6
00:00:40,344 --> 00:00:42,264
Sleepy gods’ unwritten mode

7
00:00:42,344 --> 00:00:45,465
Dust on my hands - not dust, but current flow

8
00:00:45,985 --> 00:00:48,065
I step beyond the lines they show

9
00:00:48,325 --> 00:00:54,225
I wake up - reality melts away

10
00:00:54,446 --> 00:00:59,246
The loop breaks, fear fades today

11
00:00:59,426 --> 00:01:05,007
Every breath - a reset of my dream

12
00:01:05,347 --> 00:01:37,090
I return to the place where silence reigns supreme

13
00:01:38,050 --> 00:01:41,150
Stars are pixels, the sky’s a screen

14
00:01:41,190 --> 00:01:44,071
But I feel life - this is my scene

15
00:01:44,091 --> 00:01:47,031
The world was fake, but I still played

16
00:01:47,531 --> 00:01:50,351
A foreign script, yet I chose my way

17
00:01:50,391 --> 00:01:53,391
Hear it - the code quietly bends

18
00:01:53,471 --> 00:01:55,832
Dreams turn into a whirlwind of sense

19
00:01:56,532 --> 00:01:59,272
No beginning, no end to defend

20
00:01:59,512 --> 00:02:02,012
Only the heart awakening transcends

21
00:02:02,172 --> 00:02:06,533
I wake up - reality melts away

22
00:02:08,293 --> 00:02:12,873
The loop breaks, fear fades today

23
00:02:14,794 --> 00:02:20,334
Every breath - a reset of my dream

24
00:02:20,434 --> 00:02:28,495
I return to the place where silence reigns supreme

25
00:02:28,855 --> 00:02:30,055
Silence…

26
00:02:30,235 --> 00:02:34,656
I am the one who sees the dreams

27
00:02:34,916 --> 00:02:41,196
And the one who writes them too

28
00:02:41,356 --> 00:02:42,716
This isn’t a dream…

29
00:02:42,756 --> 00:02:44,197
This isn’t chance…

30
00:02:44,317 --> 00:02:46,157
This is you…

31
00:02:46,437 --> 00:02:52,617
Inside the code

